   "body": "Done in #1041 (merged as f6753515a2603567d4465110e564eb47be52185d)\n\n- Signature text at the message text's inset, dotted rule from the edge; legacy's 10 px right padding added to the article's 1em; legacy `hr` rules ported (the quote rules were HFR's `<hr>` in `oldcitation`/`oldquote`).\n- Open for the #893 device check: whether the total right margin should be exactly legacy's, a blocked post's rule starting at 1em, and any rule still seen around a plain `citation` (needs a capture).\n- Tests are app-hosted WebKit ones, not run in the cloud session.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
